🪄 **Initial Device Setup:**
Choose how you want to discover and populate devices from your system.

💡 **Passive Sniffing Note:**
If any devices (such as 4-button scenario modules, dry contacts, or wall pushbuttons) are not discovered during active scanning, you can add them at any time by enabling **Passive Bus Sniffing** from the integration's *Configure* menu: simply press physical buttons on your walls to capture and register them instantly!
